  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Group reagents for precipitating ions:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Group</td>\t\t\t<td>Cations</td>\t\t\t<td>Group reagent</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Zero</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>None</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Dilute HCl</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>As</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>&nbsp;gas&nbsp;in presence of dil. HCl</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Al</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math>&nbsp;in presence of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>Cl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Co</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>&nbsp;in presence of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>V</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ba</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Sr</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Ca</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;in presence of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>VI</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Mg</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>None</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, the correct answer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>iv</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>ii</mi></math></p>"
